{
  "_meta": {
    "scenario": "resource-colour-spread",
    "notes": "Synthetic colour-spread demo for the resource-colour system (local_docs/design/2026-08-08-resource-colour-system.md, gonogo main repo): NOT a realistic Kerbalism profile (ElectricCharge/Oxygen are declared non-pooled here purely to earn a per-part meter for the render; a real Kerbalism install usually pools ElectricCharge vessel-wide, see partMeters.test.ts's own pooled-ElectricCharge fixture for the honest case). Exercises: (1) several curated Tier-1 resources across both contributors (LiquidFuel amber, Water blue, Oxygen cyan, Food green, ElectricCharge yellow); (2) SolidFuel and 'KerbalKrunchies' (an invented mod resource) both fall through to the Tier-2 hash fallback, proving unknowns still get a distinct legible colour; (3) Oxidizer is drained to a critical level and Food to a low level, to show the status border/badge rendering SEPARATELY from each resource's identity fill (neither meter's fill hue changes because of its status)."
  },
